{"id":3776,"date":"2017-05-31T10:41:32","date_gmt":"2017-05-31T14:41:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=3776"},"modified":"2017-05-31T10:41:32","modified_gmt":"2017-05-31T14:41:32","slug":"they-certainly-know-how-to-party","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/05\/31\/they-certainly-know-how-to-party\/","title":{"rendered":"They Certainly Know How to Party!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>This was our first experience at the Bloody Mary Party, but others in the park had been talking about the upcoming event for weeks. \u00a0Everyone looks forward to the annual gathering hosted by Bill &amp; Lee.<\/p>\n<p>We weren&#8217;t disappointed &#8230; lots of food, lots of drink (open bar \/ self serve), and LOTS of friendly talk and laughs. \u00a0This crowd knows how to party!<\/p>\n<p>Fortunately, since the guests all live here in the park, there was no danger of DUI since we could all walk home.<\/p>\n<p>Here&#8217;s a few snaps from the party &#8230; Thanks again go out to Bill and Lee for their gracious hospitality.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-3776 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-full'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/05\/2017-05-28-19.21.02-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/di